## 二、核心状态机架构
### 2.1 状态机结构设计
```mermaid
stateDiagram
    [*] --> Patrol
    Patrol --> Alert: Player detected
    Alert --> Chase: Player in range
    Chase --> Attack: Player in attack range
    Attack --> Patrol: Player escaped
    Chase --> GroupAttack: Multiple enemies
    GroupAttack --> Chase: Player still active
```

