## 三、核心状态实现
### 3.1 巡逻状态（Patrol）
```csharp
// 巡逻逻辑脚本
public class PatrolAction : ActionNode
{
    public Transform[] patrolPoints;
    private int currentPointIndex;
    
    public override void OnStart()
    {
        currentPointIndex = 0;
        GetComponent<EnemyAgent>().agent.SetDestination(patrolPoints[currentPointIndex].position);
    }
    
    public override TaskStatus OnUpdate()
    {
        EnemyAgent agent = GetComponent<EnemyAgent>();
        if (agent.agent.remainingDistance <= agent.agent.stoppingDistance)
        {
            currentPointIndex = (currentPointIndex + 1) % patrolPoints.Length;
            agent.agent.SetDestination(patrolPoints[currentPointIndex].position);
        }
        return TaskStatus.Running;
    }
}
```

**优化技巧：**
- 使用`NavMeshAgent.destination`替代`SetDestination`提升性能
- 添加巡逻点权重系统（根据场景复杂度动态调整点位）

### 3.2 侦查状态（Alert）
```csharp
// 侦查逻辑脚本
public class AlertCondition : Condition
{
    public float detectionRange = 10f;
    public float detectionAngle = 120f;
    
    public override bool OnCondition()
    {
        EnemyAgent agent = GetComponent<EnemyAgent>();
        Vector3 direction = agent.PlayerPosition.position - agent.transform.position;
        float angle = Vector3.Angle(direction, agent.transform.forward);
        
        if (Vector3.Distance(agent.transform.position, agent.PlayerPosition.position) <= detectionRange 
            && angle <= detectionAngle)
        {
            agent.Blackboard.SetVariable("IsPlayerDetected", true);
            return true;
        }
        return false;
    }
}
```

**性能优化：**
- 使用`SphereCast`替代`Distance`检测提升效率
- 添加视线检测（Line of Sight）避免无效检测

### 3.3 追击状态（Chase）
